    },
    "# 标题、**粗体**、*斜体*、`代码`、[链接](地址)、三个反引号围起来的代码块，这些写法直接显示成样式，标记只在光标所在的那一行露出来" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# heading, **bold**, *italic*, `code`, [link](address), and code blocks fenced with three backticks show as styles; the marks appear only on the line with the cursor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
