    },
    "%@不能导入。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ It can’t be imported."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@关着，先不同步；在上面「功能」里打开就接着同步" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ is off, so this isn’t syncing; turn it on under Features above to resume"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@四指捏合四根、五根手指都认（同系统），捏的时候多碰到一根也接着认；五指只认五根，和四指的横扫（切换桌面、调度中心）完全错开，不容易误开。Mac 从睡眠中唤醒后会自动重新接上触控板，不用重启。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ Four-finger pinch accepts four or five fingers, like the system, and keeps going if an extra finger touches. Five-finger pinch only accepts five, so it never overlaps four-finger swipes (switching desktops, Mission Control) and is hard to trigger by accident. The trackpad reconnects automatically after your Mac wakes, with no restart needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@太多，自动备份里没带，可以手动导出" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@: too many to include in the automatic backup; you can export them manually"
          }
        }
      }
    },
