    "%lld%%" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "%lld/%lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$lld/%2$lld"
          }
        }
      },
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "* 代表任意几个字、? 代表一个字，比如 *.tmp 跳过所有 .tmp 文件；只认名字、不认路径。右键选中的那几样自己照压，只跳它们里面的；只压一个 App 这类包时不跳，跳了签名会坏。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "* matches any characters and ? matches one, so *.tmp skips all .tmp files. Names only, not paths. The items you right-click are always compressed—only things inside them are skipped. Nothing is skipped when compressing a single app or similar package, since that would break its signature."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "* 代表任意几个字；几个名字用逗号隔开，一次加进去" : {
