    "60 fps" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "60 fps 更顺，文件大约大一半；大屏上可能录不满 60。文件嫌大：标准清晰度在高分屏上宽高各减半，文件小一半多，小字会糊一些；HEVC 同样的画面小三分之一左右，部分 App 和旧设备可能放不了。录好的也可以在角落的缩略图上点「压缩」另存一份小的。麦克风：录制条上的麦克风开着时录哪一个，选的那个没接着时这次用系统默认的；录音照旧用系统默认的输入。只显示快捷键：带 ⌘ ⌃ ⌥ 的组合键、Esc 和 F 键才进画面，打字不显示。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "60 fps is smoother, and files are about half again as large; large displays may not reach 60. If files are too big: Standard sharpness halves the width and height on high-resolution displays, making files less than half the size with slightly blurrier small text. HEVC makes the same footage about a third smaller, but some apps and older devices may not play it. You can also click “Compress” on the corner thumbnail to save a smaller copy. Microphone: which one to record when the microphone is on in the recording bar; if it isn’t connected, the system default input is used that time. Audio recordings always use the system default input. Shortcuts only: only combinations with ⌘ ⌃ ⌥, Esc, and F-keys appear in the recording; typing doesn’t."
          }
        }
      }
    },
