    "↩ 拷贝、Esc 退出、⌫ 删除标注、方向键微调、⌘D 复制标注固定不改。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "↩ copies, Esc exits, ⌫ deletes an annotation, arrow keys nudge, and ⌘D duplicates an annotation; these can’t be changed."
