    "「open 文件名」搜文件并打开，「find 文件名」在访达中显示；不想被搜到的文件夹加到 系统设置 › Spotlight › 搜索隐私。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“open <file name>” searches files and opens one, “find <file name>” shows it in Finder. To keep a folder out of search, add it in System Settings › Spotlight › Search Privacy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「关键词 空格 内容」直接用那个网站搜；没有本地结果时用开了兜底的几个搜。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“keyword <text>” searches that site directly; when there are no local results, the ones with fallback on are used."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「已复制」这类提示在刘海上停多久；带按钮的、出错的跟着变长变短，进行中的不算" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How long notices like “Copied” stay on the Notch; ones with buttons or errors scale too, ones in progress don’t"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「常用」和按使用习惯的排序会从头开始学，收藏不动。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Frequent and usage-based ranking start learning from scratch. Favorites aren’t affected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「常用」和排序会从头开始学，收藏不动" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Frequently used items and ranking start over. Favorites aren’t affected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「新建文件」里有文本文件、Markdown、Word 文档、Excel 表格、PPT 演示文稿，和模板文件夹里放的文件；「从剪贴板新建」把剪贴板里的图存成 PNG、文字存成文本文件；「自定义后缀…」建一个任意后缀的空文件，可以顺手记进菜单。建好后在访达里选中它、直接改名（要「辅助功能」授权，没有就只选中）；重名的自动加「 2」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“New File” offers Text File, Markdown, Word Document, Excel Workbook, PowerPoint Presentation, and the files in the templates folder. “New from Clipboard” saves a clipboard image as PNG and text as a text file. “Custom Extension…” creates an empty file with any extension and can add it to the menu. The new file is selected in Finder, ready to rename (requires Accessibility permission; otherwise it’s only selected). Duplicate names get “ 2” added."
          }
        }
      }
    },
