            "value" : "Download failed (%lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不会写也没关系：把这份写法说明复制给你常用的 AI，在最后一段写上想让脚本做什么，AI 会照规矩写好。把它给的脚本复制下来，回到「脚本命令」点「从剪贴板新建」，看一眼就能存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No need to write it yourself: copy this guide to your AI of choice, describe what the script should do in the last section, and it writes one by the rules. Copy the script it gives you, go back to “Script Commands”, click “New from Clipboard”, take a look, and save it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不会覆盖：重名的自动加「 2」。搬得久时刘海岛显示进度、能停下，做完带「在访达中显示」。剪切之后又拷了别的东西，剪切就作废。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing is overwritten: duplicate names get “ 2” added. For long transfers, the Notch shows progress and lets you stop, then offers “Show in Finder” when done. A cut is canceled if you copy something else afterward."
          }
        }
      }
    },
