    "便签大小" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Note size"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "便签存在这台 Mac 上，和剪贴板历史分开：清空历史、保留天数都碰不到它。每天自动备份一份，留最近 7 份（正文里的图片跟着一起备）。删掉的便签在「最近删除」里留 %lld 天。设置 › 通用 里的导出与导入带便签的文字、不带图片；要连图片一起带走、或者拿别的工具看，用上面的 Markdown 导出。在几台 Mac 之间同步到 设置 › 通用「同步」里选文件夹。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Notes are stored on this Mac, separately from Clipboard History: clearing history and the retention setting don’t affect them. They’re backed up automatically every day, and the latest 7 backups are kept (images in notes included). Deleted notes stay in Recently Deleted for %lld day. Export and Import in Settings › General include note text but not images; to take images along, or to open notes in other apps, use Markdown export above. To sync between Macs, choose a folder under Sync in Settings › General."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Notes are stored on this Mac, separately from Clipboard History: clearing history and the retention setting don’t affect them. They’re backed up automatically every day, and the latest 7 backups are kept (images in notes included). Deleted notes stay in Recently Deleted for %lld days. Export and Import in Settings › General include note text but not images; to take images along, or to open notes in other apps, use Markdown export above. To sync between Macs, choose a folder under Sync in Settings › General."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
