            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, the Launcher opens with just the search field, or only your favorites; ranking still learns from what you use"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉后表情不动、进入时不做出场、屏幕边上不冒眼睛；标题照样晃一下" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, emoji don’t move, there’s no entrance animation and no eyes peek from the edges. The title still wiggles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉后还没下好的动画表情先显示缩略图、不动，已经下好的照样动" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, animated emoji that aren’t downloaded yet show a still thumbnail. Downloaded ones still move."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉就只防系统睡眠，屏幕照常熄灭（后台下载、跑任务时省电）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, only system sleep is prevented and the display turns off as usual (saves power during downloads and background tasks)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
