    "写一句话：↩ 第一下只显示这句（红字），再按一次才跑；列表脚本打字时就跑，不能写" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A sentence: the first ↩ only shows it (in red), and the second runs the script; list scripts run as you type, so they can’t have one"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写不进去（可能没有权限）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn’t write (you may not have permission)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写入失败：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn’t write the file: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写参数的名字，如「城市」；在启动器里输「关键词 空格 文字」，文字在 $1 里，带空格的用引号括起来（\"New York\"）。可以不填的写成 `{\"placeholder\": \"城市\", \"optional\": true}`；要直接拼进网址的再加 `\"percentEncoded\": true`（先做网址编码）；只能从几个里挑的写 `\"type\": \"dropdown\", \"data\": [{\"title\": \"耳机\", \"value\": \"headphones\"}]`（打到这里时列出来挑，交给脚本的是 value）；密码写 `\"type\": \"password\"`（行上不显示、跑完清空搜索框、不记进使用记录，但打的时候搜索框里看得见，别在有人看着时用）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The argument’s name, like “City”; type “keyword, a space, then text” in the Launcher and the text is in $1; quote text with spaces (\"New York\"). An optional one is `{\"placeholder\": \"City\", \"optional\": true}`; one that goes straight into a URL also gets `\"percentEncoded\": true` (percent-encoded first); one picked from a few values is `\"type\": \"dropdown\", \"data\": [{\"title\": \"Headphones\", \"value\": \"headphones\"}]` (listed to pick from when you get there; the script gets the value); a password is `\"type\": \"password\"` (not shown on the row, the search field is cleared after it runs, and it isn’t saved to usage history, but it’s visible in the search field while you type, so don’t use it with people watching)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
