    },
    "列表里的 App 在前台时，滚轮照系统原样（也不反向）。常见的虚拟机、远程桌面和标明是游戏的 App 自动照原样，不用放进来；别的游戏、自己管滚轮的 App 放进来。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While an app in this list is in front, the wheel scrolls the way the system does (and isn’t reversed). Common virtual machines, remote desktops and apps marked as games are left alone automatically, so you don’t need to add them; add other games and apps that handle the wheel themselves."
          }
        }
      }
