    },
    "勾上后设一个密码，密钥加密后写进文件，导入时输同一个密码；不勾就只导出服务，不带密钥" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set a password and the keys are encrypted into the file; enter the same password when importing. If this is off, only the services are exported, without keys"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾上的几类在几台电脑之间保持一样，取消一类只是不再同步它。同步文件夹（连服务器时是服务器上那个文件夹）里放的是不加密的文本文件和图片，能打开这个文件夹的人都看得到。每台电脑只往自己的那份里写、读所有电脑的，改动一般几十秒到几分钟传过去（看同步盘多快；连服务器时大约一分钟一轮）。两台都改了同一条时，后改的留下（便签的另一版放进「最近删除」）；别处删掉的片段、收藏和生词，这台 Mac 上只是不再收藏；一轮要删的太多会先停下来问。停止同步后，文件夹里的东西留着，这台 Mac 上的也不动。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The selected categories stay the same across your computers; deselecting one just stops syncing it. The sync folder (or the folder on the server, when you connect to one) holds unencrypted text files and images, readable by anyone who can open the folder. Each computer writes only to its own part and reads everyone’s; changes usually arrive within seconds to a few minutes (depending on the sync service; about once a minute with a server). When two computers change the same item, the later change wins (the other version of a note goes to Recently Deleted); snippets, favorites, and words deleted elsewhere are just no longer favorites on this Mac; if a round would delete too much, syncing pauses to ask first. After you stop syncing, the folder’s contents stay, and nothing on this Mac changes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾上的功能没有默认快捷键：点菜单栏图标就能用，\n想用键叫出来到 设置 › 快捷键 里设一个。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The features you checked have no default shortcuts: use them from the menu bar icon,\nor set a key in Settings › Shortcuts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾上的功能要用到它们，各管什么写在下面。\n点「去授权」后在系统设置里打开开关，回到这里状态会自己变。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The features you checked need these; what each is for is below.\nClick Grant Access, turn on the switch in System Settings, and the status here updates by itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾上的功能要用到它，管什么写在下面。\n点「去授权」后在系统设置里打开开关，回到这里状态会自己变。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The features you checked need this; what it’s for is below.\nClick Grant Access, turn on the switch in System Settings, and the status here updates by itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾选同步" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose What to Sync"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾选要写进文件的内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Select what to include in the file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勿扰、睡眠、工作和自己建的模式都认。读的是系统日志里专注模式的切换记录，不要授权；开着时常驻一个约 4 MB 的小进程，这里和提醒都用不着时退出。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Works with Do Not Disturb, Sleep, Work and Focuses you created. It reads Focus changes from the system log, so no permission is needed; while on, a small process (about 4 MB) keeps running, and it quits when neither this nor Reminders needs it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
