    "压缩包可能坏了" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The archive may be damaged"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "压缩包可能坏了，或者加了密码（RAR 的密码这里解不开）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The archive may be damaged or password-protected (RAR passwords aren’t supported here)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "压缩包放在旁边，重名的自动加「 2」；zip 里的中文名到别的系统上解开也不乱码，也不夹带 Mac 的隐藏文件（.DS_Store、._*、__MACOSX）。解压时只有一样东西就直接放在包旁边，几样就放进和包同名的文件夹；按住 ⌥ 右键是「解压到…」，自己选放在哪；别的系统打的 zip，中文名也解得对。修复乱码文件名之后，刘海岛上能撤销。包里不带访达的标签、替身和自定义图标，要在 Mac 之间原样传，用访达自带的「压缩」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Archives go next to the originals, and duplicate names get “ 2” added. Chinese names in a zip stay readable on other systems, and Mac hidden files (.DS_Store, ._*, __MACOSX) are left out. When extracting, a single item goes right next to the archive; several go into a folder named after it. Hold ⌥ while right-clicking for “Extract To…” to choose where. Chinese names in zips made on other systems also come out right. After fixing garbled filenames, you can undo from the Notch. Archives don’t keep Finder tags, aliases, or custom icons; to move files between Macs as they are, use Finder’s own “Compress”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
