          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only enabled"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只管鼠标滚轮，触控板和妙控鼠标照系统的。按住 ⌥ 滚动时不平滑；按住 ⇧ 改成左右滚；按着 ⌘ 或 ⌃ 时交给 App（缩放这类）。滑着的时候点一下鼠标就停下。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only the mouse wheel is affected; trackpads and Magic Mouse work the way the system does. Hold ⌥ while scrolling to skip smoothing, hold ⇧ to scroll sideways, and with ⌘ or ⌃ held the app handles it (zooming and the like). Click the mouse to stop a glide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
