                  "value" : "%lld changed options; the rest are defaults"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合上盖子睡下去时关掉蓝牙，放进包里不会被蓝牙鼠标、键盘弄醒" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turns Bluetooth off when you close the lid, so Bluetooth mice and keyboards can’t wake your Mac in a bag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合上盖子睡着时关掉蓝牙，醒来再打开：放进包里不会被蓝牙键鼠弄醒" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turns Bluetooth off when you close the lid and back on at wake, so Bluetooth mice and keyboards can’t wake your Mac in a bag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合在一起" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Merge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合在一起后，这台 Mac 上的便签、片段、收藏、生词和状态屏的状态和它们的会出现在每台电脑上（同样的不重复）；设置、快捷键、功能开关（连同内置的网页搜索、翻译服务）换成已经在同步的那几台的——剪贴板的保留天数、「不记录」的 App 也跟着换，超出新保留天数的历史会清掉。之后同一条两边都改过的，后改的留下。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After merging, the notes, snippets, favorites, words, and Status Screen statuses on this Mac and on the others appear on every computer (without duplicates); settings, shortcuts, and feature switches (including built-in web searches and translation services) are replaced with those of the computers already syncing. Clipboard retention and the apps excluded from history change too, and history older than the new retention period is cleared. After that, when both sides change the same item, the later change wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合并粘贴" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paste as One"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合成失败" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn’t compose the image"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同一段里的行接起来，段和段之间保留换行：中文、日文的行直接接上，其它文字之间加空格。截图翻译总是这样接。框选里有二维码或条码时复制它的内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lines in the same paragraph are joined, and line breaks between paragraphs are kept: Chinese and Japanese lines join directly, other text gets a space. Translate Screenshot always joins this way. If the selection contains a QR code or barcode, its content is copied."
          }
        }
      }
    },
