    "在访达里右键文件、文件夹，或者文件夹窗口的空白处，就有下面开着的这几项；也能把「Kitty Tools」按钮放到访达的工具栏上（访达 › 显示 › 自定工具栏…，把它拖上去），点它是同样的几项。iCloud 云盘（包括同步到 iCloud 的桌面、文稿）和网盘的文件夹里，系统不在右键里显示这些项，用工具栏按钮。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Right-click files, folders, or empty space in a folder window in Finder to see the items turned on below. You can also add the Kitty Tools button to the Finder toolbar (Finder › View › Customize Toolbar…, then drag it in) for the same items. macOS doesn’t show them when you right-click in iCloud Drive (including a Desktop and Documents synced with iCloud) or other cloud storage folders; use the toolbar button there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
