      }
    },
    "工作目录是脚本所在的文件夹。能用的环境变量：KITTY_SCRIPT_DIR（脚本所在的文件夹）、KITTY_DATA_DIR（Kitty Tools 的数据目录）、KITTY_VERSION。退出码不是 0 算出错，最后一行显示在刘海岛上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The working directory is the script’s folder. Environment variables: KITTY_SCRIPT_DIR (the script’s folder), KITTY_DATA_DIR (Kitty Tools’ data folder), KITTY_VERSION. A nonzero exit code is an error, and its last line shows in the Notch."
