      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Greek"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "带上的是按快捷键那一刻的指针；识字、截图翻译不带。隐藏桌面图标：桌面上的文件不进截图和录屏，桌面本身照常；录屏中访达新弹出的菜单、窗口最多晚 1 秒才录进去。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The pointer is captured where it was when you pressed the shortcut; Capture Text and Translate Screenshot leave it out. Hide desktop icons: files on the desktop stay out of screenshots and recordings; the desktop itself still shows. While recording, menus and windows Finder newly opens can take up to a second to appear."
          }
        }
      }
    },
