    "开着 %lld 个；关着：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld on; off: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "开着 %1$lld 个；关着：%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开着任何专注模式（勿扰、睡眠、工作、自己建的）都算。滤镜里另选了的模式以滤镜为准：比如这里选「照常提醒」，只给「工作」加滤镜选「只在刘海上挂图标」。挂在刘海上的提醒，专注模式结束后一起弹一次。要紧的提醒在它的详情里打开「专注模式时也照常提醒」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Any Focus counts (Do Not Disturb, Sleep, Work, ones you created). A Focus whose filter picks something else follows the filter: for example, choose “Remind as usual” here and add a filter set to “Only show an icon on the Notch” to Work only. Reminders held on the Notch pop up together when the Focus ends. For important reminders, turn on “Also remind during Focus” in their details."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开着时一直挂在刘海上" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep it on the notch while on"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开着时让系统别睡；没开时什么都不跑" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prevents sleep while on; runs nothing while off"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开着盖子睡着时不关，蓝牙键盘鼠标照样能叫醒电脑" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bluetooth stays on when your Mac sleeps with the lid open, so Bluetooth keyboards and mice can still wake it"
