          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Low"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "弹出前台 App 菜单栏里的全部快捷键，按菜单分组。按着那个键再按别的键，这一下照常给 App、面板收起；松开就收起。只列 App 菜单里的快捷键，网页和编辑器里自己定义的看不到。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shows every shortcut in the frontmost app’s menu bar, grouped by menu. While holding the key, pressing another key goes to the app as usual and closes the panel; release to close. Only shortcuts in the app’s menus are listed, not ones defined inside web pages or editors."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "弹出后按着它再按别的键：这一下照常给 App，面板收起" : {
