    "拖动调整顺序，点一行编辑。按全局快捷键选状态时，卡片也按这个顺序排。至少留一个；删掉的自带状态可以从「+」里恢复。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drag to reorder and click a row to edit. When you choose a status with the global shortcut, the cards follow this order. Keep at least one; deleted built-in statuses can be restored from +."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖动调整顺序，点一行编辑。按全局快捷键选状态时，卡片也按这个顺序排。至少留一个；删掉的自带状态可以从「+」里恢复。最多 %lld 个，已经满了，删掉一个才能再加。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Drag to reorder and click a row to edit. When you choose a status with the global shortcut, the cards follow this order. Keep at least one; deleted built-in statuses can be restored from +. The list is full at %lld status; delete one to add another."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Drag to reorder and click a row to edit. When you choose a status with the global shortcut, the cards follow this order. Keep at least one; deleted built-in statuses can be restored from +. The list is full at %lld statuses; delete one to add another."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖动调整顺序，点一行编辑。排在最前面的状态就是全局快捷键进入的那个。至少留一个；删掉的自带状态可以从「+」里恢复。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drag to reorder and click a row to edit. The first status is the one the global shortcut enters. Keep at least one; deleted built-in statuses can be restored from +."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖动调整顺序，点一行编辑。排在最前面的状态就是全局快捷键进入的那个。至少留一个；删掉的自带状态可以从「+」里恢复。最多 %lld 个，已经满了，删掉一个才能再加。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Drag to reorder and click a row to edit. The first status is the one the global shortcut enters. Keep at least one; deleted built-in statuses can be restored from +. The list is full at %lld status; delete one to add another."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Drag to reorder and click a row to edit. The first status is the one the global shortcut enters. Keep at least one; deleted built-in statuses can be restored from +. The list is full at %lld statuses; delete one to add another."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖动调整顺序，结果按这个顺序显示；排在最前、翻译成功的那个服务的结果写入历史、用于自动复制和收藏。点一行进入设置。删掉的内置服务可以从「+」加回来，密钥还在。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drag to reorder; results appear in this order. The first service that translates successfully is used for history, auto-copy, and favorites. Click a row to open its settings. Removed built-in services can be added back with “+”, and their keys are kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖左右两边改宽度，拖下边改最多显示几行" : {
