    "文件夹原样交给 App；文件交给认得它的 App，不认得的改成打开它所在的文件夹。脚本和可执行文件只交给编辑器，交给终端的是它所在的文件夹，不会运行它。选了几样时编辑器全打开，终端只开第一个。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folders go to the app as they are. Files go to an app that can open them; otherwise their enclosing folder opens instead. Scripts and executables go only to editors—terminals get the enclosing folder, so nothing runs. With several items selected, editors open all of them and terminals open only the first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "文件夹名字" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folder Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "文件夹没有的话连接时新建，每台电脑填同一个。密码存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串里；有的服务要在网页上另外生成给第三方应用用的密码。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the folder doesn’t exist, it’s created when you connect. Enter the same one on each computer. The password is stored in this Mac’s keychain; some services require a separate app password generated on their website."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "文件夹窗口的空白处右键" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Right-click empty space in a folder window"
