      }
    },
    "新装时插件都没添加。添加了才出现在侧栏、菜单栏、主界面、快捷键和启动器里；移除了设置和数据都留着，再添加就回来。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plugins aren’t added on a new install. Once added, a plugin shows up in the sidebar, the menu bar, Home, shortcuts, and the Launcher. If you remove it, its settings and data stay for when you add it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新装的 App 自动追加到最后一页末尾；卸掉的从布局里拿掉。拖动排序、建文件夹、删 App 都在启动台里做。" : {
