    "浏览器和一部分用网页技术做的 App 不主动交出网页里的元素。打开后第一次停到它上面时请它打开辅助功能（只有位置和名字的那一档），一直开到它退出，可能让它稍慢一点" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Browsers and some apps built with web technology don’t expose the elements in their pages. When on, the first time you hover over one, Kitty Tools asks it to turn on accessibility (the lightest level, positions and names only); it stays on until the app quits and may slow it down slightly"
