    "点一张切过去，悬停点 ✕ 关掉；按 ⌘Tab 时也能显示" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click one to switch to it, or hover and click ✕ to close it; can also show when you press ⌘Tab"
