    "状态屏" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Status Screen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "状态屏不可用" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Status Screen isn’t available"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "状态屏会拦住键盘鼠标，按住 Esc 或者到了状态的自动结束时间才退出。没给辅助功能授权、正在录屏时进不去，改成全屏提醒。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Status Screen blocks keyboard and mouse until you hold Esc or the status ends on its own. Without Accessibility access, or while recording, it can’t start and a full-screen reminder shows instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "状态屏已结束" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Status Screen ended"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "状态屏插件没添加" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Status Screen plugin isn’t added"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "状态屏是告示加防误触，不是安全措施：没设退出密码时照着提示谁都能退出，设了也拦不住电源键、触控 ID 键和合盖。要防别人动电脑，进入之后再锁定屏幕（按一下触控 ID 键）：电脑照样不睡，回来解锁就结束——忘了退出密码也这样出来。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Status Screen is a notice that prevents accidental input, not a security measure. Without an exit passcode, anyone can follow the notice to exit, and even with one it can’t stop the power button, Touch ID button or closing the lid. To keep others off your Mac, lock the screen after entering (press the Touch ID button): your Mac stays awake and the status ends when you unlock. That’s also the way out if you forget the passcode."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "状态屏的动画表情来自 Microsoft Fluent Emoji（MIT 许可）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Animated emoji on the Status Screen come from Microsoft Fluent Emoji (MIT License)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "状态屏的状态" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Status Screen Statuses"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "状态屏里自己写的那几个状态" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Statuses you wrote yourself for the Status Screen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "状态屏需要「辅助功能」授权" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Status Screen needs Accessibility access"
          }
        }
      }
    },
