    "电脑睡下去时关掉蓝牙、醒来再打开：什么时候关、要给的授权" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn Bluetooth off when your Mac sleeps and back on at wake: when to turn it off, and the access it needs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "电脑睡下去时关掉蓝牙：放进包里不会被蓝牙鼠标、键盘弄醒，睡着的 Mac 也不会抢走手机连着的耳机。接着外接显示器时不关；关机不管。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turns Bluetooth off when your Mac goes to sleep, so Bluetooth mice and keyboards can’t wake it in a bag, and a sleeping Mac won’t take over headphones connected to your phone. Bluetooth stays on with an external display connected; shutting down isn’t affected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "电脑睡下去时关掉蓝牙：放进包里不会被蓝牙鼠标、键盘弄醒，睡着的 Mac 也不会抢走手机连着的耳机。接着外接显示器时不关；关机不管。开着盖子先睡着、之后才合上的那一次不关。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turns Bluetooth off when your Mac goes to sleep, so Bluetooth mice and keyboards can’t wake it in a bag, and a sleeping Mac won’t take over headphones connected to your phone. Bluetooth stays on with an external display connected; shutting down isn’t affected. If your Mac falls asleep with the lid open and you close it later, Bluetooth stays on that time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "电脑睡着、锁着屏或者没打开 Kitty 时到点的提醒，晚 5 分钟以内的照常提醒，更晚的回来后合成一条告诉你。每隔一阵的提醒碰上锁屏、睡眠，或者 5 分钟没碰键盘鼠标，算休息过了，回来重新数。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reminders due while your Mac was asleep, locked or Kitty wasn’t open still go off if they’re up to 5 minutes late. Later ones are combined into one notice when you’re back. For interval reminders, locking the screen, sleeping, or 5 minutes without touching the keyboard or mouse counts as a break, and the count starts over."
          }
        }
      }
