    "目标语言选「自动」时：原文是第一语言就译成第二语言，否则译成第一语言（简繁中文算同一种）。源语言和目标语言在翻译浮窗顶部切换，会一直记住。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the target language is “Auto”, text in your first language is translated into your second language, and everything else into your first (Simplified and Traditional Chinese count as one). Change the source and target languages at the top of the translation panel; they’re remembered."
          }
        }
