      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remove"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移除后按住那个键不再弹出，快捷键页里也没有它；设置留着，再添加就回来" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once removed, holding the key no longer shows anything and it’s gone from Shortcuts; settings stay for when you add it again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移除后点刘海没反应、刘海两边不挂计时；岛上的提示照常弹。设置留着，再添加就回来" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once removed, clicking the notch does nothing and no timers hang beside it; notices still appear. Settings stay for when you add it again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移除后睡眠时不再关蓝牙（关着的先打开）；设置留着，再添加就回来" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once removed, Bluetooth is no longer turned off at sleep (if it’s off now, it’s turned back on); settings stay for when you add it again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移除后菜单栏、主界面、启动器、快捷键里都没有它，设置和数据留着，再添加就回来" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once removed, it’s gone from the menu bar, Home, the Launcher, and shortcuts; settings and data stay for when you add it again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移除后鼠标滚轮回到系统原样（也不反向）；设置留着，再添加就回来" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once removed, the mouse wheel works the way the system does again (and isn’t reversed); settings stay for when you add it again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移除在它自己那一页的最下面；移除了设置和数据都留着" : {
