      }
    },
    "系统设置 › 触控板 › 更多手势 里的「应用程序」开着时，捏合交给系统，启动台不响应；关掉之后马上由 Kitty 自己读触控板来认。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While “App Exposé” is on in System Settings › Trackpad › More Gestures, pinches go to the system and Launchpad ignores them. Once it’s off, Kitty reads the trackpad itself right away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统设置里关着「自然滚动」：打开这一项，鼠标滚轮反过来，触控板不变" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
