    "网址里有 {query} 的是搜索（「关键词 空格 内容」直达，开关 = 没有本地结果时兜底），没有的是快捷链接。拖动调整顺序，搜索的关键词重复时用靠前的；点一行编辑。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entries with {query} in the URL are searches (“keyword <text>” goes straight there; the switch means fallback when there are no local results); the rest are quicklinks. Drag to reorder; when search keywords repeat, the higher one wins. Click a row to edit it."
          }
