    "脚本以你的身份运行，能用 Kitty Tools 已有的辅助功能、屏幕录制、完全磁盘访问授权，只放你信得过的。从网上下载的脚本，第一次运行前会先在启动器里给你看一眼全文。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripts run as you and can use the Accessibility, Screen Recording, and Full Disk Access permissions Kitty Tools already has, so only add scripts you trust. A downloaded script is shown to you in full in the Launcher before its first run."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "脚本以你的身份运行，能用 Kitty Tools 已有的辅助功能、屏幕录制等授权，只放你信得过的脚本；从网上下载的，第一次运行前会先给你看一眼全文。Kitty Tools 自带的大功能（便签、刘海岛这些）是插件，在 设置 › 全部插件 里添加。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripts run as you and can use permissions Kitty Tools already has, like Accessibility and Screen Recording, so only add scripts you trust. A downloaded script is shown to you in full before its first run. Larger built-in features, like Notes and the Notch, are plugins; add them in Settings › All Plugins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "脚本全文" : {
