    "脚本文件不跟着同步，也不进设置的导出；别名和开关跟着走。几台 Mac 共用，就把脚本文件夹放进 iCloud 云盘，在每台「添加文件夹…」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Script files aren’t synced or included in settings exports; aliases and switches are. To share scripts across Macs, put the scripts folder in iCloud Drive and use “Add Folder…” on each one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
