          }
        }
      }
    },
    "脚本用 .sh 文件的默认 App 打开；默认的那个不是编辑器（比如终端，一开就跑了）时，改用打开纯文本的那个编辑器。想换编辑器：在访达里选一个 .sh 文件，⌘I 显示简介，「打开方式」选好后点「全部更改…」。启动器里选中一条脚本，⌘E 就能改它。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripts open in the default app for .sh files; when that isn’t an editor (like Terminal, which would run them), the default plain-text editor is used instead. To change editors, select a .sh file in Finder, press ⌘I, choose one under “Open with”, and click “Change All…”. In the Launcher, select a script and press ⌘E to edit it."
