    "输入密码时系统会打开安全输入，这时只带 ⌥ 的快捷键收不到，按键会打进那个输入框。离开密码框或退出那个 App 后恢复；带 ⌘ 或 ⌃ 的快捷键不受影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS turns on Secure Input while you type a password. Until it’s off, shortcuts that use only ⌥ don’t respond, and the keystroke goes into that field. They work again once you leave the password field or quit that app. Shortcuts with ⌘ or ⌃ aren’t affected."
