          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These are off by default. Files starting with a dot are already hidden, so “Unhide” doesn’t appear for them; press ⇧⌘. in Finder to see hidden items. Copy Hash works only on files, and the result also goes into Clipboard History. Delete Immediately always asks first; deleted items skip the Trash and can’t be recovered."
