            "value" : "Default"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认粘贴为纯文本" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paste as plain text by default"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认给英文词英英释义；在「词典」App 的设置里勾上「牛津英汉汉英词典」并拖到最前面，就会显示中文释义" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "English words get English definitions by default. To see Chinese definitions, select the Oxford Chinese Dictionary in the Dictionary app’s settings and drag it to the top."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认颜色" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Default Color"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标上下反向" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reverse vertical mouse scrolling"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标停到钉图上时认出图里的字，在字上拖动就是选字，⌘C 拷贝。空白处照旧拖着挪，按住 ⌥ 在哪都能挪" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the pointer rests on a pin, its text is recognized: drag over the text to select it and press ⌘C to copy. Drag empty areas to move the pin as before, or hold ⌥ to move it from anywhere"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标停在侧栏、列表、按钮这些上面就框出那一块，单击截下；滚轮往上换大一块、往下换小一块，Tab 只认整扇窗口。游戏这类自己画界面的认不出来，照旧只认窗口" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hovering over sidebars, lists, buttons, and similar outlines that part; click to capture it. Scroll up for a larger area, down for a smaller one; Tab detects whole windows only. Apps that draw their own interface, like games, can’t be detected and still use the whole window"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标停在标签上时，旁边显示这条便签的开头几行" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the pointer rests on a tab, the first few lines of the note appear beside it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标停在程序坞的 App 图标上，弹出它所有窗口的缩略图" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rest the pointer on an app in the Dock to see thumbnails of all its windows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标停在程序坞的 App 图标上，看它所有窗口的缩略图" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rest the pointer on an app in the Dock to see thumbnails of all its windows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标单独反向，触控板不变" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reverse the mouse on its own; the trackpad stays the same"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标在标签上停一下就打开，不用点" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opens a note when the pointer rests on its tab, without clicking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标在程序坞的图标上停这么久才弹出，弹出后移到别的图标上马上换。点一张切到那扇窗口，悬停时点左上角的 ✕ 关掉它。最小化的、隐藏的和别的桌面上的窗口也列出来。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Previews appear after the pointer rests on a Dock icon this long, then switch right away as you move to other icons. Click a preview to switch to that window, or hover and click ✕ in its top-left corner to close it. Minimized and hidden windows, and windows on other desktops, are listed too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标左右反向" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reverse horizontal mouse scrolling"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标挪到弹出的提示上：停住、展开看全文和按钮；在岛上双指往上滑收起" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Move the pointer onto a notice: it stays and expands to show the full text and buttons; swipe up with two fingers on it to dismiss"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标推到角上停一下打开" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Move the pointer into the corner and pause to open"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标滚轮像触控板那样滑着滚，鼠标单独反向，按 App 停用" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Make the mouse wheel glide like a trackpad, reverse the mouse on its own, and turn it off per app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标滚轮滑着滚：滑多久、滚多远、鼠标单独反向、在哪些 App 里停用" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A gliding mouse wheel: how long it glides, how far it scrolls, mouse-only reversing, and the apps it’s turned off in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标离屏幕边缘多近就展开" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How close the pointer has to get to the screen edge to expand the tabs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标靠到屏幕边上的药丸就展开一列标签，点一张，便签从边缘滑出来。按住 ⌥ 拖药丸可以换边、换高度。右键一张标签可以直接固定、换颜色、浮到屏幕上、归档、删除；右键「+」或标签之间的空处有新建便签、全部便签和设置。打开的便签点别处就收起，固定（⌘P）之后不收。按住打开的便签侧边那张标签往外拖，它就浮在屏幕上、可以拉大小。浮着的便签一直在别的窗口上面；固定（⌘P）之后，重启还回到原处。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Move the pointer to the pill on the screen edge to expand a column of tabs; click one and its note slides out from the edge. Hold ⌥ and drag the pill to change the side or height. Right-click a tab to pin it, change its color, float it on the screen, archive it, or delete it; right-click “+” or the space between tabs for New Note, All Notes, and Settings. An open note closes when you click elsewhere, unless it’s pinned (⌘P). Drag the tab on the side of an open note outward to float the note on the screen, where you can resize it. Floating notes stay above other windows; once pinned (⌘P), they return to the same place after a restart."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标靠过去就能看到" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Move the pointer there to see them"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标靠过来展开便签；按住 Option 拖动可以换边、换高度" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Move the pointer here to expand notes; hold Option and drag to change the side or height"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "（没有输出）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "(No output)"
          }
        }
      }
